{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, take it, check its properties, do specific task, otherwise approach object or move to new location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
